 "blocksHtml": "<div class=\"js-grid-slider mb-5 mb-10@sm overflow-hidden user-select-none\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center\" style=\"user-select: none;\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/4@sm mr-5 mr-8@sm flex-no-shrink pointer-events-none\">\n<div class=\"mb-2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n<div class=\"js-grid-slider-text\">\n<h2 animate-from=\"preset: 'fadeUp'\" class=\"mb-1 t-500 t-lh-1.1 t-uppercase t-ls-tight t-base\">Process Snapshot</h2>\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">A look at some of the initial concept work that went into creating the projects scrolling narrative.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none js-slider-items\">\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(8%, 6%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-100\" dom2webgl=\"image27403668\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/41e5c13a5d7f.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-5%, -6%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"150\" dom2webgl=\"image27441468\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/b3a73d8720b5.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(3%, 1%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-49\" dom2webgl=\"image27421113\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/e3bf77b6a2ce.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(11%, 6%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"50\" dom2webgl=\"image27464693\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/33b6d21fa64f.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-7%, -5%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-11\" dom2webgl=\"image2759229\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/aa454a272e0b.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(10%, 7%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"1\" dom2webgl=\"image2748646\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/96bb1e4af9df.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-14%, 4%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image27663694\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/1914e8dd9acc.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-14%, 14%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"50\" dom2webgl=\"image2768675\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/a7f70c625d69.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"d-flex\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-15%, 13%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"9\" dom2webgl=\"image27454855\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/cd14b87e2574.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(13%, -15%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"50\" dom2webgl=\"image27411632\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/e350d33e7ee5.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-11%, 5%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-100\" dom2webgl=\"image27431773\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/a8dffa70ae52.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-6%, -13%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"150\" dom2webgl=\"image27501447\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/30749a6e7133.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(12%, 14%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image27499686\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/6c26df46fdd2.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(8%, 9%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"150\" dom2webgl=\"image27604792\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/5ede7c1d10a1.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-9%, 12%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-5\" dom2webgl=\"image27672975\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/7c5ce5bd840a.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-2%, 2%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"150\" dom2webgl=\"image27697357\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/0bd6a099e442.jpg\"/></div></div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nProject Objectives\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nThe Convex Seascape Survey is an ambitious 4 year research programme, investigating and quantifying carbon storage in coastal seas around the globe. The website is an introduction to the concept of seascape carbon storage and the role we believe the ocean plays. The immersive experience is the first piece of a larger campaign that will span the next 3 years. The core objective for this phase of the campaign was raising awareness and understanding around carbon storage in our oceans. Our aim was to educate a broad segment of the general public and help them understand the importance of the topic and the need for research around it.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/0c7e2b7c3fe2.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2736\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/564ec2d033d3.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2735\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nCreating the narrative\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nWith such a complex subject and and broad target audience the challenge was explaining the science in an accessible way, using plain language and a logical narrative flow to guide the user on an educational journey, without overwhelming them with unnecessary content and scientific jargon. For a deeper insight into the process behind creating this immersive website follow the link below.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<a class=\"btn btn--regular btn--fill btn--light js-btn\" data-btn=\"fill\" data-cursor=\"hide\" href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<span class=\"btn__inner js-btn-inner\">\n<span class=\"btn__content js-btn-content\">\n<span class=\"d-flex flex-row items-end\">\n<span class=\"btn__text\">\nLearn More\n</span>\n<svg class=\"btn__icon d-inline-block js-btn-icon\">\n<use href=\"#arrow\"></use>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image27376aaa775274858\" src=\"/media/79b44d6634f0.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/473ee898b4f6.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2738\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container d-flex@sm items-center justify-center mb-5 mb-20@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm mb-6 mb-0@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: 30, rotationZ: 3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '30%' : 0 }, rotationY: 10, rotationZ: -3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/acbbbd6a89f3.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: -30, rotationZ: -3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '-10%' : 0 }, rotationY: -10, rotationZ: 3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/0a96fe4858a0.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/2f9d67273a4e.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2739\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nIntegrated AR experience\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nThe AR easter egg was integrated into the website to add another layer of immersion for the user to experience along the journey. The experience was created as part of a larger educational campaign. We also created a virtual reality experience taking you on a journey to discover what a healthy ocean looks like. \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/39eadef480f3.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2594\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"preset: 'mobileWithText'\" class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"relative w-1/2\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--3/2 aspect--1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"aspect__child\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<video data-src=\"/media/61bcea4ca928.mp4\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n<video data-src=\"/media/8ed6d435a01d.mp4\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/3@sm js-phone-start\">\n<div class=\"w-3/4@sm visible\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<h2 class=\"mb-1.5 t-1.5 t-3@sm t-lh-1 t-normal\">The campaign</h2>\n<p class=\"t-lh-1.3 mb-0 js-mobile-caption\">\nWe created the immersive AR experience for World Ocean Day which allowed users to walk with whales and encouraged them to share their experience on social media using the hashtag #walkwithwhales to raise awareness for ocean health.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center justify-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/3@sm js-phone-end\">\n<div class=\"w-3/4@sm visible\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<h2 class=\"mb-1.5 t-1.5 t-3@sm t-lh-1 t-normal\">The results</h2>\n<p class=\"t-lh-1.3 ml-auto mb-0 js-mobile-caption\">\nThe campaign was a huge success with over 4.5 Million people reached, and people all around the globe sharing their own ‘Walk With Whales’ experience.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative w-1/2\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--3/2 aspect--1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"aspect__child\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm | js-awards\">\n<div class=\"container my-5 d-block d-flex@sm my-10@md overflow-hidden\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-2/5@sm pr-0 pr-3@sm relative\">\n<h2 class=\"t-lh-1.1\">\n<span class=\"pl-0.25 t-serif t-italic t-500 t-2 t-3@sm\">Awards &amp; <br/></span>\n<span class=\"t-sans t-500 t-2 t-3@sm\">Recognition</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"award-trophy absolute fill w-1/1 h-1/1\" dom2webgl=\"c:Awards\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-3/5@sm pt-1 pt-5@sm user-select-none\">\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"awwwards\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>Awwwards</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nSite of the Day\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"fwa\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>FWA</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nSite of the Day\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"css\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>CSSDA</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nSite of the Day\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
